ambrosia: Ah, Sabrina! About time you showed up.
sabrina: Wh-- Where am I?
ambrosia: Late to the grand opening. I’d write you up for this but I guess I can let it slide considering you were out cold from that concussion.
sabrina: The what?
ambrosia: Oh, honey. You don’t remember that either?
sabrina: ...
ambrosia: Well, no matter. The customers are hungry! Let’s get you going!